                        %mi R
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} prod \;\colon\; R \wedge \cdots \wedge R \to R
                  under the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28infinity%2C1%29-functor"} (infinity,1)-functor
                  which forms Tate spectra.
